e_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-e-o004a-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-49a6b8e43bb034d3e7b1","layer":"original","quote":"顷之，袁术遣从弟胤代尚为太守〖10〗，而瑜与尚俱还寿春。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o002","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-eb9da279c4fbb4292ea9","layer":"original","quote":"瑜长壮有姿貌〖4〗。初，孙坚兴义兵讨董卓，徙家于舒。坚子策，与瑜同年，独相友善；瑜推道南大宅以舍策〖5〗，升堂拜母，有无通共。瑜从父尚为丹杨太守〖6〗，瑜往省之。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o004","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-49a6b8e43bb034d3e7b1","layer":"original","quote":"顷之，袁术遣从弟胤代尚为太守〖10〗，而瑜与尚俱还寿春。术欲以瑜为将；瑜观术终无所成，故求为居巢长，欲假途东归〖11〗。术听之，遂自居巢还吴。是岁，建安三年也。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":80,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
